  "description": "Bring energy, movement, and vintage character to your designs with Atlanta, a bold sporty retro script font inspired by classic athletic lettering and racing aesthetics.\nFeaturing expressive curves, thick letterforms, and dynamic swashes, Atlanta delivers a confident and energetic look that stands out in logos, sports graphics, apparel branding, and promotional designs. Its bold script style makes it ideal for creating eye-catching typography with a nostalgic yet powerful personality.\nPerfect For:\nSports Branding & Team Logos\nAthletic and Racing Graphics\nStreetwear & Apparel Design\nVintage Logos & Badges\nPosters & Promotional Graphics\nYouTube Thumbnails & Social Media\nPackaging & Merchandise\nRetro-Inspired Branding\nWhether you’re designing a sports identity, a vintage-inspired logo, or bold promotional artwork, Atlanta brings a distinctive retro spirit to your creative projects.\nMake your lettering bold, dynamic, and unforgettable with Atlanta.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring energy, movement, and vintage character to your designs with Atlanta, a bold sporty retro script font inspired by classic athletic lettering and racing aesthetics.</p>\n<p>Featuring expressive curves, thick letterforms, and dynamic swashes, Atlanta delivers a confident and energetic look that stands out in logos, sports graphics, apparel branding, and promotional designs. Its bold script style makes it ideal for creating eye-catching typography with a nostalgic yet powerful personality.</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>Sports Branding &amp; Team Logos<br>\nAthletic and Racing Graphics<br>\nStreetwear &amp; Apparel Design<br>\nVintage Logos &amp; Badges<br>\nPosters &amp; Promotional Graphics<br>\nYouTube Thumbnails &amp; Social Media<br>\nPackaging &amp; Merchandise<br>\nRetro-Inspired Branding</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing a sports identity, a vintage-inspired logo, or bold promotional artwork, Atlanta brings a distinctive retro spirit to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>Make your lettering bold, dynamic, and unforgettable with Atlanta.</p>",
